{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"U_kgDOCUT68w","is_bot":false,"login":"ChaiXinLong-tech","name":""},"body":"Parent: #33\n\n/bounty $50\n\n## Task\nAdd a small API utility named $fn() that detects whether a string contains the Unicode cjk radical lame four character (U+2E91).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Add ^Gpps/api/src/utils/is-cjk-radical-lame-four-present.ts.\n- Export $fn(input: string): boolean.\n- Return \true only when the input contains the cjk radical lame four character.\n- Keep the helper dependency-free and covered by the batch TypeScript smoke tests.","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABJA2cWg","author":{"login":"yanyishuai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Claiming #5844 — `isCjkRadicalLameFourPresent`. /claim #5844","createdAt":"2026-07-07T03:30:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/5844#issuecomment-4899839066","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABJB6_xw","author":{"login":"KelvinLiu117"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim #5844\n\nWorking on a focused implementation for `isCjkRadicalLameFourPresent` with a minimal dependency-free helper and local smoke verification.","createdAt":"2026-07-07T06:49:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/5844#issuecomment-4900962247","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABJB7gOw","author":{"login":"KelvinLiu117"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR: https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/pull/5862\n\nImplemented the dependency-free `isCjkRadicalLameFourPresent` helper and verified it locally with `npm test`, a direct smoke import, and `git diff --check`.","createdAt":"2026-07-07T06:51:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/iss